        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Marine Air Control Group 48, Marine Air Control Squadron 24, 4th Marine Aircraft Wing, Marine Forces Reserve, United States Marine Corps, United States Navy\n- Places: Naval Station Great Lakes, North Chicago, Lake County, Illinois\n- Topics: aviation command and control, boot camp\n\nFacts:\n- Naval Station Great Lakes is located near North Chicago in Lake County, Illinois.\n- Naval Station Great Lakes is the home of the United States Navy's only boot camp.\n- Marine Air Control Group 48 is a United States Marine Corps aviation command and control unit based at Naval Station Great Lakes.\n- Marine Air Control Group 48 is currently composed of four squadrons.\n- Marine Air Control Group 48 provides the 4th Marine Aircraft Wing and Marine Forces Reserve with a tactical headquarters, positive and procedural control of aircraft, air defense, and aviation command and control.\n- Marine Air Control Squadron 24 falls under the command of Marine Air Control Group 48 and the 4th Marine Aircraft Wing.",
